msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Oh god, it hurts... The hell kind of demon are you?\r\n"
"Do you even realize how many asses ya just kicked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Will you leave us alone now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Ugh... fine. We'll stay away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Trust me. We don't want jack shit to do with this.\r\n"
"C'mon, guys. Let's get outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Wha⑬ Walkin' away, are ya? Fuckin' wusses!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Quiet, peanut gallery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Oh, uh... Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Whether you're in Okinawa or Tokyo, these half-assed\r\n"
"schemes of yours just aren't gonna work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Yeah, okay... We're sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"If you really get it, then you'll change your ways and start living an "
"honest life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "We get it! We get it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Um... here. This is for scarin' us straight..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "You got <Color:8>150,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Let's hightail it outta here, m'dudes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "(Hope they've learned their lesson.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Ooowww! It huuurts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Hey! Watch where you're goin', jackass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Hm... Don't I know you from Downtown Ryukyu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "What? Oh shit, it's you...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you're the guys who kept bumping into me.\r\n"
"What are you doing in Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"We, uh... couldn't pull the bump scam in Ryukyu anymore, so we're seekin' "
"greener pastures up here in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"We thought it would be easy pickings, on account of there being more people "
"to bump into."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"Guys... Tokyo's no place for two-bit, get-rich-quick schemes. This city is "
"tougher than you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Hey, asswipes! You the guys that scammed my friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"He told me you bumped into him and then took his money to pay for the "
"\"medical bills\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Oh... uh... well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "Fuck you guys! We're gonna kill you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "Ack!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Augh! Please, let us go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Like hell we will! How about we shake you down and show you what "
"<Italic>real</Italic> medical bills look like!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Augh! Please, let us go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Aniki, help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Who are you calling Aniki? You made your bed, now lie in it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Folks from Okinawa gotta look out for each other! Please, we'll do anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"We never thought we'd be held accountable for our actions! Please, Aniki, "
"save us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "I can't help you. You dug yourselves into this hole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "Take responsibility or you'll never climb out of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Don't be that way, bro! Pretty please?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "All right, fine... but just this once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Sweet mercy, thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid ""
"Okay, gentlemen. How about settling this the easy way? I'll personally make "
"sure these clowns pay back the money they stole."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid "We'll give it all back! Every last yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "No can do. This isn't about the money; this is about respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid ""
"We just won't be able to sleep until we've rearranged these shitheads' "
"faces!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid "...The hard way it is, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "This is what you get for sticking your nose into other peoples' shit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "Hey guys, mess them up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Save the Scammers"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Leave Them to Their Fate"
msgstr ""

